jtndPavdKWAxVNcfUHHY_1BbUQ3IcHCMEBKAo",null,null,null,null,null,3,null,2]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,["zh-Hant"],[["中規中矩的微台拉店，份量不少，雞白湯250含半顆蛋各兩片豬和雞叉燒一般雞湯味還行，特製鹽味豚骨320元，在一般上又加了三片海苔兩片雞叉燒半顆蛋，湯喝起來有點像麻油海苔風味。\n拉麵沒啥記憶點，整碗麵最印象深刻的就是雞胸叉燒，跟健身餐盒吃起來差不多，可能吃乾麵或餐盒比較好一點。\n叉燒飯份量很大味道不錯，但大碗又調味單一很膩。\n拉麵店常見價位，用餐環境有一點擠，服務人員偏機器人。\n結論：在附近且天氣不熱且特別想吃麵的時候可以考慮，沒有特地來吃會回訪的慾望。",null,[0,137]]]],[null,null,null,null,null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/15899995124172379402/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjFLUjFGNlFuSk5XRTVQVFVSa2FWWlhNVkZQU0VwUVUwWlNiMWR0WXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/15899995124172379402/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjFLUjFGNlFuSk5XRTVQVFVSa2FWWlhNVkZQU0VwUVUwWlNiMWR0WXhBQhAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/15899995124172379402/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjFLUjFGNlFuSk5XRTVQVFVSa2FWWlhNVkZQU0VwUVUwWlNiMWR0WXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/15899995124172379402/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjFLUjFGNlFuSk5XRTVQVFVSa2FWWlhNVkZQU0VwUVUwWlNiMWR0WXhBQhAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/15899995124172379402/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjFLUjFGNlFuSk5XRTVQVFVSa2FWWlhNVkZQU0VwUVUwWlNiMWR0WXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/15899995124172379402/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjFLUjFGNlFuSk5XRTVQVFVSa2FWWlhNVkZQU0VwUVUwWlNiMWR0WXhBQhAA"]],[null,null,6256,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21KR1F6QnJNWE5PTURkaVZXMVFPSEpQU0ZSb1dtYxAB!2m1!1s0x0:0x4cdc39f421078bf!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOmJGQzBrMXNOMDdiVW1QOHJPSFRoWmc%7C%7C?hl\u003dzh-TW"],["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21KR1F6QnJNWE5PTURkaVZXMVFPSEpQU0ZSb1dtYxAB\u0026t\u003d1\u0026entityid\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjl